# Template-owned instruction surface.
#
# Every path listed here is mirrored verbatim from this template into a derived
# repository by `make template-sync`, including deletions inside listed
# directories. A service may retain a local `.agents/skills/<name>` sibling
# only with a `.service-owned` marker; the sync preserves that skill regardless
# of Git status and keeps its Claude/Qwen discovery links out of the sync commit. It
# still mirrors and deletes every unmarked template-owned skill. A path may
# appear here only while it carries no
# repository-specific content: no service name, no module path, no deployment
# target, no owner, and no initialization-profile marker. `make
# template-owned-purity-check` enforces the manifest's structural safety and
# rejects profile-specific content; broader content portability remains a
# review responsibility and the sync refuses target-module contamination.
#
# Repository-specific instructions belong in the repo-owned documents named in
# docs/template-sync.md. They are never listed here and the sync never reads or
# writes them.
#
# Syntax: one path per line, relative to the repository root. A trailing slash
# marks a directory, mirrored recursively with deletions. Blank lines and lines
# starting with `#` are ignored.

AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
Grok.md
QWEN.md

